# CAUTION: do not edit this file by hand!
# _targets/objects/ may have large data files,
# and _targets/meta/process may have sensitive information.
# meta/meta is excluded too: several targets use tar_cue(mode = "always")
# and rewrite their meta row (timestamp/order) on every run even when
# their content hash is unchanged, which caused spurious git diffs.
*
!.gitignore
